      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——虽然新宇宙的真实身份仍是个谜，\r\n但既然她不是会危害他人的存在，那就必须帮她一把。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ebddd8a9413ed2a981b464ebdaa449c3dcfc308f83904ff2858653bd919dd0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
