      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "难道是……尤妮同学……？\r\n……为什么大家要追她呢……？\r\n（荒漠英雄对新宇宙的称呼为“Uni”，这里音译为尤妮）",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ee8a642bc1d76e7c3b2862c97b9eccf23ebc2c452df7e219d8b32d945e4656c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
