      "uid": "zhcn:40b83058fa973225b538f1ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实在是太过可疑了。\r\n这我当然明白——但我也是唯一一个与她有过接触的人。\r\n我努力地向众人解释，她并非什么危险人士……",
      "source_fingerprint": "808213aa1995d8f980041a32fc8b891b6f73ff0886cb6305200489aa5f47ec0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
